{# The Savva mark, declared once for the whole document.

   `sprite()` goes into the page body exactly once (layouts/base.njk); `mark()`
   and `monogram()` are <use> references to it. Two reasons the mark is inline
   SVG and not <img src>: the single path is fill="currentColor", which is what
   makes it dark on the cream bar and cream on the espresso footer, and
   src/assets/images/ is not copied to the output at all.

   Before this file the two paths were pasted five times into every page —
   about 12 KB of the 79 KB document, identical on both languages. #}

